2026-10-15T17:32:19.0715743Z [1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer[0m
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0805851Z [32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0814659Z [0m
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0815339Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0815996Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0816248Z 
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0816468Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0817028Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0817334Z 
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0817859Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0818515Z    if you are ready to continue.
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0818821Z 
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0819241Z 3. Create the system users [34m(uids [30001..30008])[0m and groups [34m(gid 30000)[0m
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0819911Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0820415Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0820812Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0820994Z 
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0821177Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0821504Z 
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0821731Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0822170Z    can use Nix.
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0822335Z 
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0822451Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0822620Z 
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0822966Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0823616Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0827975Z 
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0828117Z I will:
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0828301Z 
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0828514Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0829022Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0829514Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0830135Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0830533Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0830910Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0831426Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0831924Z    /root
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0840867Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0841911Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0851629Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0852172Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0852367Z 
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0853987Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-10-15T17:32:19.0854602Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
